Well, Vulture's Eye *is* a work in progress.  I believe they're open to
people creating new tiles for them -- I did just that for AllegroHack.

There's another point I should make: Nethack isn't one person's (or,
usually in the industry these days, a committee's) vision magnified and
made flesh through the actions of a dedicated team of programmers and
artists.  It's more of a kind of cloud, there's less of a directing
force than a general sense of what's "right" for the game, and people
generally work on what they want to see added.  Some of the better
changes get added to the core game, and if they don't they may get
incorporated into Slash.


